!/quarantine/README.md
/fable-findings.md
# Local visual-fidelity retrospective. Keep candid process notes out of releases.
/plans/visual-fidelity-lessons-learned.md

# --- Reference imagery + parked subsystems (never commit — CLAUDE.md §3 Filing) ---
art-direction/library/
art-direction/kit-evidence/
art-direction/pg-progress/
art-direction/references/
art-direction/reference-cache/
.parked-*/

